  organizational comparison>>|<cell|<strong|Units>>|<cell|<strong|Declaration-span
  lines>>|<cell|<strong|Share of lines within the units>>|<cell|<strong|Share
  of 32 units>>>|<row|<cell|NLSM-nearest exact UV format and
