  separates scalar parameter matching from
  <hlink|<verbatim|ShapeControl>|https://github.com/yang-mills-group/OpenAI-YM-20261028/blob/3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464/YM/UVNext/COUPLING_RESET/Advance.lean#L78-L103>.
  <hlink|<verbatim|YM/AnalyticBridge/VERIFIED_RESET_STEP/Evaluation.lean:17\U29>|https://github.com/yang-mills-group/OpenAI-YM-20261028/blob/3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464/YM/AnalyticBridge/VERIFIED_RESET_STEP/Evaluation.lean#L17-L29>,
  <hlink|<verbatim|YM/AnalyticBridge/VERIFIED_RESET_STEP/Evaluation.lean:71\U95>|https://github.com/yang-mills-group/OpenAI-YM-20261028/blob/3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464/YM/AnalyticBridge/VERIFIED_RESET_STEP/Evaluation.lean#L71-L95>
