  Eqs.(0.28)\U(0.30), and B-N-II ŸŸ4\U5, pp.698\U718, supply older marginal
  extraction and renormalization conditions.

  <strong|Classification.> Mixed older constructive RG and ADAPTED-NLSM for
  the particular mask-complement reset; high confidence in exact-format
  matches, medium in closest-source ranking. GK85 pp.218\U221,
  Eqs.(5.32)\U(5.53), already removes Taylor terms, reassembles the
  bad-region density and restores the original interaction class with new
  coupling and wave-function normalization. BY90 pp.360\U361
  Eqs.(1.17)\U(1.23) and pp.364\U366 Eqs.(2.1)\U(2.10) gives another exact
  extraction/reblocking identity. Exact density restoration itself is older;
