  terms into the regular and compulsory classes.
  <hlink|<verbatim|YM/RG/History.lean:25\U33>|https://github.com/yang-mills-group/OpenAI-YM-20261028/blob/3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464/YM/RG/History.lean#L25-L33>
  explicitly treats this as an action-representation coordinate rather than
