  <strong|Evidence.> <hlink|<verbatim|YM/Independent/ConstructionRun.lean:14\U31>|https://github.com/yang-mills-group/OpenAI-YM-20261028/blob/3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464/YM/Independent/ConstructionRun.lean#L14-L31>
