  discussed in Ÿ4.3.

  <strong|Classification.> <hlink|III.15|outline/units/III-15.tm>: STANDARD
  derivative/fusion estimates 60%, ADAPTED-NLSM reassembly affinity 20%,
  specialized gauge cost bounds 20%. <hlink|III.16|outline/units/III-16.tm>:
  STANDARD analytic tools about 90%, specialized packaging 10%; medium-high
  confidence. Cauchy's inequality, product derivative bounds and
  positive-operator trace estimates should not be credited as new NLSM or
